@startuml
!theme crt-green
participant System as Client
participant Server
Client->Server: Client details (TLS Version requested, Cipher Suites)
Server->Server: Choose TLS Version & Cipher Suite
Server->Client: Chosen TLS Version, Cipher Suite\nServer Certificate (Public Key)
Client->Client: Review issuer certificate public key\nVerify Certificate
Server->Client: Request client credentials
Client->Server: Client certificate
Server->Server: Review issuer certificate public key\nVerify Certificate
@enduml
